WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.501
-It is Tuesday.
It is time for "WeTweet."

00:00:02.501 --> 00:00:07.801
Here we go, everyone.
-♪ "WeTweet" ♪

00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:09.267
♪ "WeTweet" ♪

00:00:09.267 --> 00:00:11.334
-Welcome to "WeTweet."

00:00:11.334 --> 00:00:12.934
This is where we, as a group,

00:00:12.934 --> 00:00:15.534
decide something
that we should post on Twitter.

00:00:15.534 --> 00:00:17.434
I'm going to show you
five different tweets,

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:18.534
and we're all going to
vote on whether

00:00:18.534 --> 00:00:19.734
you like each one or not.

00:00:19.734 --> 00:00:21.133
You all have voting clickers
at your seats?

00:00:21.133 --> 00:00:23.200
[ Crowd cheers ]
Good.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:26.667
You can vote all of them,
you can vote for none of them,

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:28.634
whatever you want,
and we'll see the results live.

00:00:28.634 --> 00:00:30.167
Hopefully you vote for
all of them.

00:00:30.167 --> 00:00:31.934
Higgins, Roots,
you have clickers, too?

00:00:31.934 --> 00:00:33.234
-Got it.
-Every vote counts.

00:00:33.234 --> 00:00:35.434
-Whatever tweet
gets the most likes,

00:00:35.434 --> 00:00:37.567
we're going to tweet it out
live on the show

00:00:37.567 --> 00:00:40.601
so that you can all like it
and "WeTweet" it.

00:00:40.601 --> 00:00:43.234
[ Laughter ]
It's a shared experience.

00:00:43.234 --> 00:00:44.567
Alright,
you guys ready for this?

00:00:44.567 --> 00:00:47.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:47.133 --> 00:00:48.501
First tweet is...

00:00:52.467 --> 00:00:54.100
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:55.868
-Wow!
♪♪

00:00:55.868 --> 00:00:57.000
-That's the joke.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:01.133
That's the -- No one
has phoned it in harder.

00:01:01.133 --> 00:01:04.601
"I got a good name for
those things -- blueberries."

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:07.300
Wow.

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:09.067
-This might get negative.

00:01:09.067 --> 00:01:10.968
-You voted --
It's gonna be negative votes?

00:01:10.968 --> 00:01:12.000
-Yeah,
I think it'll be negative.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.367
-I think -- Wow.

00:01:14.367 --> 00:01:16.434
I mean,
it was a stunned silence.

00:01:16.434 --> 00:01:18.968
-Yeah, it was a stunned silence.

00:01:18.968 --> 00:01:21.400
-Alright, you say 50% --
less than 50%.

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:22.901
-Yeah. Yeah.

00:01:22.901 --> 00:01:25.200
-Wow. I kind of agree with you.
Tariq, what do you think?

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:27.100
-I'm going to agree
with Higgins on this one.

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:29.701
-You didn't vote?
You always vote yes.

00:01:29.701 --> 00:01:32.501
-Yes, I vote yes.
-But on this one, did you?

00:01:32.501 --> 00:01:34.567
-I kind of did, yeah.
-Alright.

00:01:34.567 --> 00:01:37.234
He's very honest. Votes are in.
Let's see the results.

00:01:37.234 --> 00:01:38.234
[ Drumroll ]

00:01:38.234 --> 00:01:41.067
-Ooh, my God!
-Oh, yeah!

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:44.834
-Thirty-three.
-Was it that bad?

00:01:44.834 --> 00:01:47.033
That's not an original name --
blueberries.

00:01:47.033 --> 00:01:48.634
This guy kind of phoned it in
a little bit.

00:01:48.634 --> 00:01:50.901
-More like a sentence.

00:01:50.901 --> 00:01:52.033
-This next one here says...

00:01:56.734 --> 00:01:58.033
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:01:58.033 --> 00:02:00.701
There's got to be a --
-This is going to be better.

00:02:00.701 --> 00:02:02.367
-He's got a Bat phone.
He's got everything.

00:02:02.367 --> 00:02:03.667
-You can't call him?

00:02:03.667 --> 00:02:04.834
-No, he has to keep
looking out his window and go,

00:02:04.834 --> 00:02:05.834
"Oh, not yet."

00:02:05.834 --> 00:02:07.367
-Anybody? No.

00:02:07.367 --> 00:02:09.167
-"They need me?
No, they don't need me yet."

00:02:09.167 --> 00:02:11.100
Alright,
let's see the results here.

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:12.367
I feel better about this one.

00:02:12.367 --> 00:02:13.501
[ Drumroll ]

00:02:13.501 --> 00:02:15.534
Oh!
-Oh, wow!

00:02:15.534 --> 00:02:17.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:17.667 --> 00:02:19.267
Alright, thank you.
-Yeah.

00:02:19.267 --> 00:02:21.801
-Now I know that
your thumb's-up button works,

00:02:21.801 --> 00:02:23.100
that's good to know.

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:24.934
I was worried for a second.

00:02:24.934 --> 00:02:26.501
Alright, this next one says...

00:02:30.267 --> 00:02:32.267
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:36.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:51.367
Alright, let's see the results.

00:02:51.367 --> 00:02:53.000
[ Drumroll ]

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:54.501
Yeah, not bad.
-Oh!

00:02:54.501 --> 00:02:56.901
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Batman.

00:02:56.901 --> 00:02:58.667
Batman's still in the lead.
-Yeah.

00:02:58.667 --> 00:03:00.100
-Alright, how about this?
Next up, it says...

00:03:03.868 --> 00:03:04.934
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:03:04.934 --> 00:03:07.167
We tried it.

00:03:07.167 --> 00:03:09.567
We tried as hard as we could.

00:03:09.567 --> 00:03:11.734
Not going to work.
Not going to be a thing.

00:03:11.734 --> 00:03:13.534
-People tried.
-People tried hard.

00:03:13.534 --> 00:03:14.634
They tried with kale.

00:03:14.634 --> 00:03:16.067
Kale kind of
took off for a little bit.

00:03:16.067 --> 00:03:17.300
-Brussels sprouts took off.
-Had one or two good records.

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:18.467
-Yeah.

00:03:18.467 --> 00:03:20.567
-Cauliflower, it ain't --
just not going to do it.

00:03:20.567 --> 00:03:22.567
Let's see the results
on this one.

00:03:22.567 --> 00:03:23.567
[ Drumroll ]

00:03:23.567 --> 00:03:25.601
Oh, wow!
-Oh, wow!

00:03:25.601 --> 00:03:26.801
No, thank you.

00:03:26.801 --> 00:03:29.167
-Some people chose
not to play at all.

00:03:29.167 --> 00:03:31.033
"I am not --
I'm not going to waste my b--

00:03:31.033 --> 00:03:32.467
my energy to type
in that button there."

00:03:32.467 --> 00:03:33.534
-Wow.

00:03:33.534 --> 00:03:34.567
-Alright,
this last one here is...

00:03:39.067 --> 00:03:41.234
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:03:41.234 --> 00:03:45.567
I feel like it's going to be --
-I like this one.

00:03:45.567 --> 00:03:47.033
-It's the Batman.

00:03:47.033 --> 00:03:48.868
-Yeah, Batman for the win.
-It's gotta be. Yeah.

00:03:48.868 --> 00:03:49.968
Alright, here we go.

00:03:49.968 --> 00:03:51.767
Let's see the results
right here.

00:03:51.767 --> 00:03:52.801
[ Drumroll ]

00:03:52.801 --> 00:03:54.701
Ooh, not bad.
-Oh!

00:03:54.701 --> 00:03:57.100
The winner is Batman!

00:03:57.100 --> 00:04:00.267
Oh, my God.
-Whoa!

00:04:00.267 --> 00:04:01.767
-"...a light in the sky."

00:04:01.767 --> 00:04:03.801
I'm going to post this
during the commercial break.

00:04:03.801 --> 00:04:06.033
If you see it on your feed,
give it a like,

00:04:06.033 --> 00:04:07.634
give it a "WeTweet," and enjoy.

